GENERAL
-Design 1 character
-Make 1 full scene
-

OUTLINE DAY
First 30 minutes
-Draw 1 object as best as you can. Only using color as a way to seperate different elements from each other but NOT to actually color the piece (yet).
Then when the 30 minutes is up, you want to: Preserve the outline of your sprite, then get its silhouette and finally all of the basic shapes its
made of. Then you pull up a pixel art reference of the same or similar object and get their outline, silhouette and break it down into basic shapes. Then compare your sprites to their's and see whats different.

Last 30 minutes
-Draw as many megaman sprite edits as you can applying what you learned (ONLY USING BLACK. SAVE COLOR FOR COLOR DAY)

COLOR DAY
First 30 minutes
-Make palettes using the color combos you learned (like monochrome, analagous etc)
-Make your own custom color palette
Last 30 minutes
-Apply what you learned to color in the outlines you drew from outline day
